      <p class="_abstract">Kubernetes KMS v2 uses external Key Management Services to encrypt etcd data and centralize key management.</p>
      <p>Kubernetes KMS v2 provides:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>Customer-managed encryption keys that never leave the external KMS</li>
      <li>Centralized key management and auditing</li>
      <li>Regulatory compliance support</li>
      </ul>
