      <p>When you enable KMS encryption, OpenShift Container Platform encrypts the following sensitive resources in etcd:</p>
      <ul>
      <li>Secrets</li>
      <li>ConfigMaps</li>
      <li>Routes</li>
      <li>OAuth access tokens</li>
      <li>OAuth authorize tokens</li>
      </ul>
